WEBVTT

00:03.130 --> 00:03.730
All right.

00:03.730 --> 00:08.860
CHRISTMAS PARTY

00:04.100 --> 00:08.860
Today's the day of the Christmas party 
organized by the student council.

00:09.220 --> 00:13.200
We have to coordinate with the other schools
on venue business and the final setup.

00:13.200 --> 00:15.930
There's still a lot to do before we open.

00:15.930 --> 00:18.270
Let's hang in there and see this through.

00:20.150 --> 00:23.100
Do you have a moment, Prez?

00:23.100 --> 00:24.380
What is it?

00:24.660 --> 00:26.800
I have a request of sorts.

00:27.810 --> 00:32.890
I'd like to leave the venue 
for a bit during the event.

00:33.500 --> 00:34.930
Did something come up?

00:35.420 --> 00:39.640
Yes. I think it should only take 
around fifteen minutes or so.

00:43.260 --> 00:44.320
Got it.

00:44.740 --> 00:47.760
That can be your break time.

00:48.510 --> 00:50.130
Thank you!

00:50.130 --> 00:53.230
In return, no break for you, Nozomu.

00:53.820 --> 00:57.620
You'll be helping 
with my work all day.

00:57.620 --> 00:58.450
Ack!

00:58.450 --> 01:03.070
That's your reaction to spending the day 
with your cute, lovely older sister?

01:03.070 --> 01:04.630
You should be happy.

01:07.270 --> 01:08.170
Hey, Umi.

01:08.170 --> 01:09.590
What's the plan now?

01:10.930 --> 01:15.850
I think I'll go home, grab lunch, 
and then head over to your house.

01:15.850 --> 01:18.680
I'm not going to be 
dressing up that much today,

01:18.680 --> 01:20.280
but I might as well.

01:21.390 --> 01:23.070
"Might as well"?

01:23.070 --> 01:28.690
I feel like you panicked hard once we 
found out Maki-kun could come, too.

01:28.690 --> 01:30.870
What even are you talking about,

01:30.870 --> 01:34.880
milady who failed a subject and 
only has to write an essay to cover it

01:34.880 --> 01:40.040
because the teacher bestowed 
good grace and mercy upon her?

01:41.690 --> 01:44.970
I'm so sorry!

01:46.600 --> 01:49.390
We'll head out, then.

01:51.720 --> 01:52.730
Maki.

01:53.880 --> 01:56.100
Will you really be all right on your own?

01:56.790 --> 01:57.590
Yeah.

01:58.470 --> 02:01.910
I just need you there when it's go time.

02:04.490 --> 02:09.630
What I'm about to do is 
clearly not commendable.

02:10.620 --> 02:16.020
But if I want to deal with the unresolved 
feelings I've been bottling up inside,

02:16.020 --> 02:18.700
I believe this is a bridge 
that I simply have to cross.

02:19.510 --> 02:22.930
Sorry for asking you 
to come all the way here,

02:24.800 --> 02:26.010
Minato-san.

03:57.000 --> 03:58.960
KANESHIROYAMA PARK

03:59.640 --> 04:01.930
How did my dad react?

04:02.250 --> 04:04.660
He already had plans 
that he couldn't cancel,

04:04.660 --> 04:06.680
so all of this got his head spinning.

04:06.680 --> 04:13.040
It's understandable, given his son 
asked to discuss future plans with him.

04:16.580 --> 04:18.290
It wasn't just Minato-san.

04:18.290 --> 04:21.390
I called my dad and asked 
to see him for a chat, too.

04:21.960 --> 04:25.910
Of course, he turned me down at first, 
saying he was too busy with work.

04:26.700 --> 04:30.560
My top-choice college is closer 
to your place, Dad.

04:31.090 --> 04:34.640
If I get in, I was considering living 
with you and going from there.

04:35.080 --> 04:37.850
Got it. I'll make time for sure.

04:40.850 --> 04:42.220
When we first met,

04:42.820 --> 04:46.100
I got the impression that 
you were a quiet, timid kid.

04:46.470 --> 04:48.610
That's how I usually am, yes.

04:48.610 --> 04:54.760
But I decided to cause some trouble 
for you grown-ups by throwing a tantrum.

04:55.490 --> 04:59.420
Still, I'm surprised you agreed 
to come talk to me.

05:00.770 --> 05:03.530
The man I love hasn't been 
acting like himself.

05:03.530 --> 05:05.510
Of course I'd be worried.

05:06.980 --> 05:10.690
And I want to help him any way I can.

05:10.690 --> 05:14.120
You really love my dad, don't you?

05:15.170 --> 05:15.920
I do.

05:16.490 --> 05:21.460
He stuck with me even though 
I was the worst new hire of the crop

05:21.460 --> 05:24.190
and made me who I am today. 
I owe him everything.

05:25.800 --> 05:30.810
I truly admire and respect him, 
both as a person and a man.

05:34.550 --> 05:36.650
Let me cut right to the chase.

05:36.960 --> 05:40.540
Maki-kun, it doesn't have to be 
until after you graduate high school,

05:40.540 --> 05:43.200
but could you go back 
to living with Itsuki-san?

05:45.550 --> 05:46.740
Why should I?

05:46.740 --> 05:50.190
He needs you by his side.

05:50.190 --> 05:52.960
Not me, but you—his son.

05:53.750 --> 05:58.700
He's so full of life 
whenever he talks about you.

06:00.270 --> 06:04.920
He flashes a bright smile that 
I never get to see otherwise.

06:08.040 --> 06:11.560
Please, go back to Itsuki-san.

06:12.980 --> 06:17.110
Do you realize how thoughtless 
you're being right now?

06:17.390 --> 06:18.640
I'm fully aware.

06:19.270 --> 06:21.500
I lied to come here during work hours,

06:21.500 --> 06:23.850
I didn't tell my boss, Itsuki-san, 
what I was going to do,

06:24.270 --> 06:26.990
and I'm sure this will hurt 
your mother greatly, too.

06:27.910 --> 06:31.540
I'm ready to accept any punishment, 
and if you don't like my being around,

06:31.860 --> 06:35.120
I'll never show my face before you again.

06:37.980 --> 06:39.880
And what about my dad?

06:40.330 --> 06:43.170
I'll quit my job and 
get out of his life, too.

06:44.930 --> 06:49.760
I see how serious you are about this,
 though I don't understand why.

06:50.710 --> 06:53.270
So that's a no, then?

06:53.610 --> 06:55.040
What did you expect?

06:55.410 --> 07:01.160
I'm not the kind of compassionate guy 
whose heartstrings you can pull.

07:03.480 --> 07:06.730
Minato-san, will you be free later?

07:12.290 --> 07:18.000
COMBINED HIGH SCHOOL CHRISTMAS PARTY

07:13.470 --> 07:15.140
Thank you very much.

07:15.140 --> 07:17.230
Sorry to ask you to do that, Maehara-kun.

07:18.000 --> 07:19.640
Prez.

07:20.550 --> 07:22.260
No, I'm the one who asked too much.

07:22.260 --> 07:23.840
Stop right there.

07:23.840 --> 07:28.130
I'd appreciate it if you could 
stop calling me that.

07:28.130 --> 07:29.070
Huh?

07:29.070 --> 07:32.060
Sure, I'm the student 
council president now,

07:32.060 --> 07:34.890
but I won't be next year.

07:35.330 --> 07:37.440
Uh, in that case...

07:38.220 --> 07:40.770
Tomoo-senpai?

07:42.790 --> 07:45.020
You went straight to my first name?

07:45.020 --> 07:48.320
You're quite daring, Maehara-kun.

07:49.560 --> 07:52.220
I mean, Nozomu's my close friend.

07:52.220 --> 07:55.620
Using your last name feels like 
it wouldn't be specific enough.

07:55.620 --> 07:58.460
Ah, so that's why.

07:58.460 --> 08:02.210
I'll do the same starting now, then.

08:02.210 --> 08:03.090
Maki-kun,

08:03.620 --> 08:05.370
let's do our best today.

08:05.370 --> 08:07.920
Of course. Let's do this.

08:08.830 --> 08:10.560
Maki-kun!

08:13.510 --> 08:16.380
Yo, that girl's hot.

08:16.380 --> 08:19.820
Is she a model or something? 
She looks way too good in that dress.

08:19.820 --> 08:22.480
She's blonde. Is she from overseas?

08:22.480 --> 08:27.140
It's her. That super-pretty girl they 
were talking about at our school, too.

08:25.580 --> 08:27.880
Hey, Amami-san. Where's Umi?

08:27.880 --> 08:29.200
Oh, uh...

08:29.750 --> 08:33.660
We came here together, but she's 
still staring at the bathroom mirror.

08:34.580 --> 08:36.620
Speak of the devil.

08:36.620 --> 08:37.770
Yuu...

08:38.220 --> 08:41.920
Were you running your mouth to Maki again?

08:43.980 --> 08:46.490
Of course not.

08:46.490 --> 08:47.940
Right, Maki-kun?

08:47.940 --> 08:52.890
Y-Yeah, right. 
She didn't tell me anything.

08:53.950 --> 08:55.850
Hey, Umi.

08:56.230 --> 08:57.560
Wh-What?

08:58.030 --> 09:01.020
You look great in that dress.

09:01.980 --> 09:06.320
As always, I'll have to dock points 
for your limited word use.

09:06.800 --> 09:10.240
But I'll accept it as
 an honest compliment.

09:10.630 --> 09:13.700
Yeah, I really do think it's great.

09:14.390 --> 09:17.660
I get it! Don't say any more!

09:18.660 --> 09:21.440
I think Amami-san looks great too,

09:22.040 --> 09:25.080
but it's always Umi 
who gets my heart racing.

09:26.230 --> 09:29.220
Just how head over heels am I for her?

09:29.220 --> 09:31.000
Um, excuse me?

09:31.000 --> 09:32.430
How may I help you?

09:32.830 --> 09:34.610
Oh, Nitta-san?

09:34.610 --> 09:35.390
'Sup.

09:35.640 --> 09:38.620
Huh, Ninacchi? What's up?

09:38.620 --> 09:42.120
Didn't you say you'd be 
coming with your boyfriend?

09:42.120 --> 09:46.110
Oh, yeah. That was the plan.

09:47.200 --> 09:50.610
But a lot happened last-minute.

09:50.610 --> 09:52.320
Long, long story.

09:52.580 --> 09:55.900
So let me help out!

09:55.900 --> 09:58.660
Being with all of you would 
take my mind off things, too!

09:58.660 --> 10:00.570
Yeah, let's do that.

10:00.570 --> 10:03.150
I'd have more fun with you around, too.

10:03.350 --> 10:04.920
Yuu-chin...

10:04.530 --> 10:05.500
Maki.

10:05.500 --> 10:07.320
It happened again, huh?

10:06.430 --> 10:08.190
It's almost time for you to go, right?

10:08.190 --> 10:08.710
Yeah.

10:08.980 --> 10:10.300
Take over for a bit.

10:15.300 --> 10:16.950
Okay, I'm off.

10:18.910 --> 10:20.470
All right, everyone!

10:20.940 --> 10:22.330
Cheers!

10:22.330 --> 10:24.140
Cheers!

10:27.510 --> 10:28.530
Mom.

10:30.850 --> 10:34.200
Should you really be out here, Maki?

10:34.200 --> 10:37.670
The party's just started.

10:37.670 --> 10:42.130
Yeah. I got permission from the 
person in charge, so don't worry.

10:42.130 --> 10:45.480
Anyway, sorry to ask you to come here.

10:45.480 --> 10:49.290
It's fine. I don't have work, 
so I'm free today.

10:49.600 --> 10:52.690
So, what did you want to talk about?

10:52.690 --> 10:54.590
Hang on for a bit.

10:54.590 --> 10:56.780
I should be getting a call any minute.

10:56.780 --> 10:57.590
Huh?

11:01.290 --> 11:02.020
Hello?

11:04.350 --> 11:06.040
Thank you very much.

11:08.070 --> 11:09.300
If you would, please.

11:13.510 --> 11:15.320
Thanks for coming,

11:15.950 --> 11:16.890
Dad.

11:19.150 --> 11:21.660
I'm sorry I lied to you two.

11:27.550 --> 11:28.880
It's been a while.

11:29.310 --> 11:31.830
Yes... Yes, it has.

11:33.640 --> 11:35.830
Dad, Mom.

11:35.830 --> 11:37.630
Aren't you going to talk?

11:37.630 --> 11:41.980
We haven't been together in so long. 
Don't you have anything to say?!

11:42.830 --> 11:44.700
What am I supposed to say?

11:46.310 --> 11:49.450
Would you happen to be Minato-san?

11:50.600 --> 11:51.730
It's nice to meet you.

11:52.270 --> 11:54.060
I'm Minato Kyouka.

11:56.330 --> 11:57.900
I'm Maehara Masaki.

11:58.760 --> 12:01.210
He and I aren't together anymore,

12:01.210 --> 12:05.080
so feel free to do with him as you wish.

12:05.080 --> 12:09.350
No, I don't believe I have that right.

12:09.350 --> 12:10.250
Yeah?

12:11.030 --> 12:13.650
I see you're still making your women cry.

12:14.320 --> 12:15.960
You wouldn't understand.

12:16.860 --> 12:20.700
Not again. Why are you always like this?

12:20.700 --> 12:23.050
Always evasive, always running away.

12:23.590 --> 12:26.420
If what I'm saying gets on your nerves, 
then say something back!

12:26.420 --> 12:28.980
If you just want to yell and scream 
at me, go right ahead.

12:29.360 --> 12:32.620
Maki, if this is all,

12:32.620 --> 12:34.110
I have better things to do—

12:35.860 --> 12:37.530
Please wait, Itsuki-san!

12:37.990 --> 12:39.260
Let me go, Minato.

12:39.260 --> 12:41.360
And call me Chief here.

12:41.650 --> 12:44.140
No. I won't let you go, 
and I won't call you that.

12:44.140 --> 12:45.140
Minato!

12:45.140 --> 12:48.750
Are you going to turn 
your back on Maki-kun again?

12:48.750 --> 12:51.000
I know you miss him 
and it kills you inside!

12:52.590 --> 12:54.750
You lied to me to skip out on work.

12:55.200 --> 12:57.140
You'd best be ready for the consequences.

13:02.090 --> 13:03.050
Dad.

13:03.050 --> 13:04.140
Mom.

13:05.350 --> 13:07.720
Please make up!

13:08.210 --> 13:09.770
Stop fighting!

13:09.770 --> 13:11.630
Let's go back to how we were!

13:12.320 --> 13:13.480
You...

13:14.290 --> 13:16.750
I don't want to choose one or the other!

13:17.690 --> 13:19.900
HAPPY BIRTHDAY

13:26.790 --> 13:29.370
ENTRANCE CEREMONY

13:30.910 --> 13:31.980
Maki.

13:31.980 --> 13:34.530
I'll do better, okay?

13:34.950 --> 13:36.830
I'll study more, play more sports...

13:36.830 --> 13:39.960
I don't have many friends right now,

13:40.470 --> 13:43.600
but I'll try to be more sociable!

13:44.050 --> 13:46.640
I want to be with you both!

13:47.160 --> 13:48.640
If it's not the both of you—

13:48.950 --> 13:52.310
if it's not the two of you together,

13:54.240 --> 13:56.360
I want no part of it!

13:58.550 --> 14:00.360
Sorry, Maki!

14:00.750 --> 14:02.570
I got held up!

14:03.480 --> 14:04.500
Umi...

14:06.210 --> 14:10.040
Anyway, that's all I wanted to say.

14:11.230 --> 14:15.000
Sorry for dropping that on you. 
I know it's too late.

14:15.410 --> 14:19.250
Also, Dad, remember what I said 
on the phone today?

14:19.790 --> 14:23.840
You never planned 
on living with me, right?

14:24.170 --> 14:24.760
Yeah.

14:27.140 --> 14:31.310
Dad, I've fallen in love here.

14:32.480 --> 14:35.650
Her name is Asanagi Umi.

14:37.130 --> 14:39.640
The first friend I ever made in my life,

14:40.500 --> 14:44.990
and the girl who taught me how to love.

14:46.990 --> 14:48.940
Dad, Mom,

14:48.940 --> 14:51.660
can I ask you for one last thing 
before we go?

14:54.430 --> 14:58.170
I'd like for us to take 
a picture by that tree.

14:59.950 --> 15:03.550
You heard Maki. What will it be?

15:03.550 --> 15:08.760
Our son normally never throws tantrums. 
Let's give him what he wants.

15:09.640 --> 15:11.150
Right you are.

15:11.150 --> 15:13.960
Umi, can you take the picture?

15:15.490 --> 15:21.600
I could, but I'm not very good, 
so I think I'll ask for some help.

15:21.600 --> 15:23.150
Huh? From who?

15:23.710 --> 15:24.900
Hey!

15:24.900 --> 15:27.360
Get out here, guys!

15:28.950 --> 15:29.700
Huh?!

15:30.070 --> 15:32.720
Brr! I'm so cold!

15:32.720 --> 15:35.860
I didn't tell my sister
 I was coming out here.

15:35.860 --> 15:39.010
You'll have to come 
apologize with me, Maki.

15:39.010 --> 15:41.880
Wait, I feel like I shouldn't be here.

15:42.180 --> 15:45.900
Nina, could you take the picture? 
You're good at it.

15:45.900 --> 15:47.580
You're asking me?

15:49.280 --> 15:52.970
Okay, are you three ready?

15:53.230 --> 15:54.980
Say cheese!

16:11.540 --> 16:13.080
Wow.

16:13.080 --> 16:15.950
Those uniforms take me back.

16:16.270 --> 16:18.960
I never thought about it 
when we went there,

16:18.960 --> 16:21.110
but they really stand out, huh?

16:29.050 --> 16:30.430
Umi...

16:30.430 --> 16:33.780
Wait, are you thinking about 
making up with them?

16:33.780 --> 16:34.570
Yeah.

16:35.260 --> 16:38.230
I've been thinking about it.

16:38.620 --> 16:42.560
Back then, I let everything 
I'd kept bottling up explode

16:43.110 --> 16:46.440
and angrily told them that we were done.

16:47.050 --> 16:53.120
But after getting closer to Maki 
and hashing things out with Yuu,

16:53.120 --> 16:56.080
all of that's faded away.

16:56.430 --> 17:00.450
Now I recall all the fond memories 
I'd locked away because I was angry.

17:01.380 --> 17:04.630
Sorry. I know I'm being self-centered.

17:04.630 --> 17:06.130
No, you're not.

17:06.780 --> 17:08.590
Eh, it's fine.

17:09.350 --> 17:13.470
We're kids. We're allowed 
to want what we want.

17:14.020 --> 17:16.690
I want you to make up with them.

17:17.240 --> 17:20.190
My parents can't anymore,

17:20.930 --> 17:24.690
but it's not too late for you.

17:25.070 --> 17:29.260
It's okay to want what I want...

17:30.340 --> 17:32.860
Hey there, Umi-chan and Yuu-chan.

17:32.860 --> 17:35.900
First time since your school fest, right?

17:35.900 --> 17:37.140
Yeah.

17:37.140 --> 17:38.000
Listen...

17:38.000 --> 17:42.340
Stop! I don't want you 
to apologize or anything!

17:42.340 --> 17:44.600
Heck, I was partly in the wrong, too.

17:45.860 --> 17:48.540
When I saw you two hanging out with Yuu,

17:48.540 --> 17:51.280
I should've gone straight up 
and confronted you.

17:52.020 --> 17:54.840
I could've just asked you, 
like, "Why'd you lie to me?"

17:55.300 --> 17:56.890
I mean,

17:57.270 --> 17:59.370
we were friends forever.

18:01.550 --> 18:03.540
Hey, don't cry on me!

18:03.540 --> 18:08.080
We've been wanting to make up 
with you for so long.

18:08.080 --> 18:13.880
But we know what we did. 
We thought you'd never forgive us!

18:14.590 --> 18:17.700
Okay, make-up handshake, now.

18:21.870 --> 18:24.830
If you ever lie to me again, 
I'll kick your asses, okay?

18:24.830 --> 18:27.950
Yeah! Send me flying!

18:28.610 --> 18:30.460
Me, too!

18:32.070 --> 18:34.430
I said not to cry!

18:34.780 --> 18:37.470
Make-up hug!

18:38.420 --> 18:40.470
What is even going on?

18:44.160 --> 18:48.150
Okay, that does it for 
all the staff duties, too.

18:48.150 --> 18:52.610
Thank you for all your help 
with the event.

18:53.150 --> 18:53.950
Thank you!

18:53.950 --> 18:55.560
Great job!

19:00.440 --> 19:01.720
I'm here.

19:04.080 --> 19:05.750
Let's go.

19:06.460 --> 19:07.280
Yeah.

19:16.550 --> 19:17.920
What are you looking at?

19:18.470 --> 19:21.960
The photos I took 
at the party venue earlier.

19:33.480 --> 19:34.490
Good.

19:35.170 --> 19:37.460
I'm actually smiling in them.

19:37.460 --> 19:38.310
Yeah.

19:38.870 --> 19:40.780
This one's really nice.

19:41.470 --> 19:45.130
I never liked photographs before.

19:45.130 --> 19:47.510
I didn't like how I looked,

19:47.510 --> 19:51.630
and they always brought back memories 
of the time they were taken.

19:52.830 --> 19:54.580
But things have changed.

19:55.160 --> 19:57.510
I have Umi beside me now.

19:59.530 --> 20:01.250
Hey, Umi?

20:01.820 --> 20:02.720
What?

20:03.060 --> 20:05.850
I love you.

20:10.880 --> 20:12.110
You mean...

20:12.840 --> 20:15.830
in a more-than-friends way?

20:15.830 --> 20:21.240
Yeah. I want to be able to say 
I love you as my girlfriend.

20:22.160 --> 20:25.410
I mean, who knows 
what the future has in store?

20:25.990 --> 20:28.400
We could end up fighting,

20:28.400 --> 20:31.380
and we might not even want 
to see each other's faces at times.

20:32.730 --> 20:36.800
But even if that day comes, 
I'll always give you all I have.

20:39.790 --> 20:43.800
So please be my girlfriend.

20:44.390 --> 20:47.410
I know I'm nothing special,

20:47.840 --> 20:51.270
but I'll become a better guy for you.

20:52.290 --> 20:53.450
I love you.

20:54.980 --> 20:56.560
Are you crying?

20:57.490 --> 20:59.200
Shaddup, you jerk!

21:00.990 --> 21:06.260
Of course I'd cry when you 
ask me out like that!

21:06.260 --> 21:09.710
Heck, I know you're tearing up, too!

21:10.550 --> 21:13.670
Hey, I'm a big crybaby.

21:17.310 --> 21:18.850
You're so warm.

21:18.850 --> 21:21.630
Am I? Glad to hear it.

21:27.100 --> 21:28.330
You meanie!

21:28.330 --> 21:31.260
I held it in when I told you how I felt!

21:31.260 --> 21:34.140
Oh, I had a feeling you did.

21:37.180 --> 21:40.030
We're really alike, huh?

21:40.300 --> 21:43.820
You said it. We're the crybaby duo.

21:44.160 --> 21:46.170
The heck?

21:46.170 --> 21:48.330
But I guess it sounds right.

21:48.330 --> 21:51.860
Right? It's perfect for us.

21:59.520 --> 22:01.250
And so,

22:02.140 --> 22:04.620
we went from friends to lovers.

